  "description": "It all started with a rumor. A legend. A myth. The people of Grand Gaia never truly understood what was happening in their world. A shadow. A silhouette. An invisible man. Throughout the centuries, many have heard those rumors… Reports… Sightings of an older looking figure standing near places of great historical importance. It seems to be a recurring phenomenon, an older man being spotted near Emperors as they are preparing to invade hostile lands… Or shadowing behind Tyrants who are looking down on their subjects… This figure has even been seen during the original formation of the Akras Summoners’ Hall… Is this really a legend? Or maybe this is much more than that…",
  "summon": "I am but a silhouette on our history’s canvas.",
  "fusion": "Only time will tell…",
